WEBVTT

00:00:02.581 --> 00:00:06.944
Press Start ride, and the plan takes the bike: every interval sets its own

00:00:06.944 --> 00:00:07.893
resistance.

00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:15.449
Six fifty-two in, it is round one's recovery: one thirty-eight left, then thirty

00:00:15.449 --> 00:00:20.554
seconds of work at level twenty-four. A hundred and seven watts, on target.

00:00:23.228 --> 00:00:28.095
Power versus plan draws every interval's target as a block, and your watts over it,

00:00:28.095 --> 00:00:29.451
up to six hundred.

00:00:36.133 --> 00:00:40.361
With a video, it plays locked to the ride clock at your offset, above the plan's

00:00:40.361 --> 00:00:41.454
progress strip.

00:00:49.038 --> 00:00:54.107
Raise, lower, or pick one of thirty-two levels. Sent to bike logs every command, and

00:00:54.107 --> 00:00:56.700
the next interval takes the plan back.

00:01:01.942 --> 00:01:05.920
Flat resistance holds one level, level twelve, for the whole ride.

00:01:12.266 --> 00:01:17.712
Start ride saves the workout to your account, so Custom workout opens on it next

00:01:17.712 --> 00:01:21.007
time. A plan Telo Ride refuses cannot start.

00:01:25.170 --> 00:01:28.090
The custom ride, from a phone to the full screen.

00:01:35.494 --> 00:01:40.097
Telo Ride, from the Telo family, turns a smart bike at home into a game.

00:01:40.443 --> 00:01:44.954
It pairs with the bike over Bluetooth, reads your power and sets resistance for

00:01:44.954 --> 00:01:46.625
every hill and interval.

00:01:46.971 --> 00:01:52.149
Two doors: Race (ride a map against your best-time ghost, bots or people) and

00:01:52.149 --> 00:01:57.597
Classes (ride along to a video, alone or with a group), fed by one progression of

00:01:57.597 --> 00:02:00.587
XP, rider levels, stars and map unlocks.

00:02:00.932 --> 00:02:03.424
A custom workout lives under Profile.
